📌 QUICK REFERENCE
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Pattern                          │ Purpose
──────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
WHERE col IN (a, b, c)          │ Value is one of a, b, or c
WHERE col NOT IN (a, b, c)      │ Value is none of a, b, or c
WHERE col IN (SELECT ...)        │ Value appears in another query result
WHERE col NOT IN (SELECT ...)    │ Value does not appear in another query result


