🎓 SUMMARY
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

• IN simplifies multiple OR conditions.
• NOT IN returns the inverse set.
• Subqueries make IN dynamic and data-driven.
• Avoid NULLs in NOT IN lists.
• Use IN on indexed columns and short lists for best performance.
• Combine IN with AND/OR for flexible filtering.

